{
  "$comment": [
    "DeckXI design tokens — THE source of truth. Nothing else may declare a token value.",
    "Run `pnpm --filter @deckxi/ui tokens` after editing; CI fails if the generated",
    "output under src/generated/ is stale. See docs/design/direction.md for the why.",
    "",
    "Two tiers:",
    "  primitive — raw ramps and scales. Theme-independent. Components must NOT use these.",
    "  semantic  — the roles components consume. Themes remap roles onto primitives;",
    "              a theme never invents a raw colour.",
    "",
    "A value of the form {color.ink-900} is a reference into `primitive`. It emits as",
    "var(--ink-900) in CSS and as the resolved literal in the TypeScript mirror.",
    "Per-theme colours live under semantic.<theme>.color and are mirrored into TS as a",
    "Palette; composites (gradients, shadows) are CSS-only.",
    "",
    "v4 — the cardboard direction (mockup turn 7). Cream stock, one ink for every",
    "outline, hard offset drops, and a single ember accent. The night/gold ramps stay",
    "as primitives for the rarity foils; nothing in the chrome reads them any more."
  ],
  "primitive": {
