      "composite": {
        "$comment": [
          "The cardboard language: every edge is the same ink, drawn at --edge width,",
          "and elevation is a hard offset drop of that ink — a piece cut out and laid on",
          "the stock. The green field is a flat fill (kept as a gradient so it can sit",
